{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> This is the demo version of <i>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke</i>. Enjoy the limited experience! If you like it, be sure to add it to your wishlist to get notified when the full version is released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can climb up to <strong>400 meters</strong>, with <strong>3 different sections</strong> to explore. The full version will feature <strong>over 1500 meters</strong> of climbing and at least <strong>6 sections</strong>.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/extras/Header.png?t=1745513958\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke \u2013 Two Minds, One Monkey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this unique <strong>co-op climbing game</strong>, full control is in your and your friend\u2019s hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Control a single monkey as a duo!</strong><br>\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Overcome challenging levels with unique mechanics and reach the top!</strong><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/extras/Heigths.gif?t=1745513958\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Single or Multiplayer Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play completely solo or share control with a friend!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>See Your Steam Friends' Latest Heights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Track your friends' progress and challenge them to climb higher!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/extras/MonkeHeightScore.gif?t=1745513958\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Two Different Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are active. The timer is disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore Mode:</strong> Checkpoints are disabled. The timer is active.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2714 In <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>, your completion time is recorded on the <strong>leaderboard</strong> after every successful climb!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Steam Leaderboard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Finish the game in Hardcore Mode to secure your place on the leaderboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Uniquely Designed Levels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every level introduces new mechanics and obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb to the top alone or with a friend, and reach the ultimate peak!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/extras/Wishlist.gif?t=1745513958\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600540?t=1745513958","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600540?t=1745513958","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/2435bdc1ea46b709f7bef727567fe64010535d40/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745513958","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600540/2435bdc1ea46b709f7bef727567fe64010535d40/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745513958","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note:</strong> This is the demo version of <i>Co-Ape: Rise of the Monke</i>. Enjoy the limited experience! If you like it, be sure to add it to your wishlist to get notified when the full version i